WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
We're nearing the end of 2020

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:05.250
and that means it's time

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:09.830
for one of our favorite annual
traditions on this show.

00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:10.920
That's right.

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:15.210
Our own resident cinephile, Andy Richter,

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:19.030
is gonna tell us about
the best and the rest

00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:22.169
of movies that came out this year.

00:00:22.169 --> 00:00:24.836
(intense music)

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:38.020
Um, I mean, did anything
really come out this year?

00:00:40.522 --> 00:00:42.760
(intense music)

00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:44.143
Oh wait, wait, wait.

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:48.920
I saw that one where
the lady (beep) a fish.

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:50.493
Did that come out this year?

00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:53.150
No.

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:54.578
Oh.

00:00:54.578 --> 00:00:57.328
(intense music)

